; Two difficulty slots for the same CI smoke chart, so the song-select smoke run has a
; difficulty to toggle with (DTXMania only cycles difficulties when a song has more than one).
; L1 -> slot 0, L2 -> slot 1; the named high score table keys its sections off those slots
; ([Drums.0] / [Drums.1]), so the box has to change content when the toggle is pressed.
; smoke2.dtx is made by the workflow from smoke.dtx with a different #DLEVEL.
#TITLE: CI Smoke Test
#L1LABEL: BASIC
#L1FILE: smoke.dtx
#L2LABEL: EXTREME
#L2FILE: smoke2.dtx
